---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Base title={`Sources and Method | ${SITE_NAME}`} description="Where our garage door opener programming steps and compatibility data come from.">
  <section>
    <h1>Sources and method</h1>
    <p>Opener details, Learn button colours and remote compatibility come from the manufacturers' own owner's manuals, support articles and compatibility charts. Car steps come from each vehicle's owner's manual. Every page links to its source where we have one.</p>
    <p>We record the facts (which remote works with which opener, where the button is, the order of the steps) and write the instructions in our own words. We don't copy manual text or images.</p>
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>If a step didn't work for you, please <a href="/contact/">tell us</a> your opener model and what happened.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
